	(text "USB-C sink, 5 V only. 5.1k on each CC identifies a sink. No USB PD.\nVBUS_RAW feeds two independent paths: the charger IN (R20 removable), and the U3 eFuse fallback.\nU3 RILIM 80.6k gives 1110-1300 mA per the TPS25200 table.\nU3 clamps OUT to 5.25-5.55 V and shuts off above 7.6 V; input withstands 20 V.\nD2 absorbs ESD and short transients on VBUS. It is not an overvoltage regulator.\nSBU1/SBU2 unused. Shield goes to GND through R12 at the connector."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
